   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Harm to the environment",
     "md": "The **environment** is everything around us: air, water, soil, plants and animals. People can harm it by **cutting forests** without replanting (**deforestation**), by **burning** rubbish and forests, by **dumping rubbish** and plastic, by **polluting** water and air, and by **over-hunting and over-fishing**. Plastic bags block drains and take a very long time to rot."
    },
